### Store accessToken only in your PRIVATE HTTP-client environment.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@month = 2026-10

### Current streak and calendar month, using the profile time zone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-streak
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Choose a calendar month; current/longest streak still use all history up to today
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-streak?month={{month}}&timeZone=Asia%2FHo_Chi_Minh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### UTC can assign an overnight session to a different local date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-streak?month={{month}}&timeZone=UTC
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Invalid month -> 400 INVALID_POMODORO_STREAK_FILTER
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-streak?month=2026-13
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
